  "version": 1,
  "title": "Weil Bounds Toolkit",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of the classical prime-modulus Kloosterman-Weil bound |S_p(m,n)| <= 2 sqrt(p) for nonzero m, n, proved by the Carlitz-Stepanov method following Harcos's exposition, together with an exact Chinese-remainder factorization of unit Kloosterman sums, a squarefree-modulus bound for a unit first coefficient, a bound for the sum defined at the reduced modulus q/gcd(A,q), and interval-length-uniform and weighted bounds for centered incomplete reciprocal sums.",
